<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">- A conversational voice and text AI built into SkySwitch&#x27;s white-label UCaaS (cloud phone) platform. It is sold to resellers, who rebrand it.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">- It works as an AI receptionist, customer service agent or sales agent. It routes calls, books appointments, answers FAQs, qualifies leads and covers after-hours calls.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">- It gets a phone number or PBX extension, and a no-code drag-and-drop builder sets up the call flows.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">- No third-party AI vendor. One bill, one support line, and partner margins of up to 70%.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">- Other AI on the platform: post-call analysis, live agent assist and smart wrap-up in the Contact Center, plus voicemail and live call transcription in the UC Client.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
